Wrote `coder-2.json`: SB 1457 (2021) — Petersen co-sponsored and voted Yea — is coded `record`/`own-act` across all three snapshots but marked `adjacent`/`off-axis` on relevance, since the bill's operative clauses (sex/race/genetic-abnormality-selective abortion ban, clinic and informed-consent regs, a narrow public-school-facility ban) don't set a general gestational-stage-and-exceptions rule matching any of the five rungs. Row is `BLANK` / `no-evidence`, with `needs_source` flagging a general-limit bill or statement as what's missing.
